     [38;5;246mA personal task list in the browser. "Notification" means reminders and due dates, not "someone changed a task" — a
[39m     [38;5;246mvery different and much smaller system, likely no backend at all.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Single user, multiple devices
     [38;5;246mOne person, but tasks sync across phone/laptop. Needs a server for sync; notifications are mostly reminders plus [39m
     [38;5;246m"changed on your other device".[39m
